{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335","id":704237527,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU3MDQyMzc1Mjc=","number":4335,"title":"Synchronize all pending operations","user":{"login":"dionhaefner","id":11994217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExOTk0MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11994217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner","html_url":"https://github.com/dionhaefner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dionhaefner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2020-09-18T09:37:51Z","updated_at":"2020-09-20T13:01:49Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"With `mpi4jax` we are running into a problem when Python exits before a pending operation has the chance to be executed.\r\n\r\nWhen using MPI, `MPI_Finalize` runs at interpreter exit. Any MPI operation called *after* that will deadlock, which can happen due to JAX's  asynchronous dispatch.\r\n\r\n**Is there a way to force synchronization of *all* pending XLA operations?** Then we could register that as an `atexit` handler that runs before `MPI_Finalize`.\r\n\r\n`block_until_ready` doesn't work for 2 reasons:\r\n\r\n1. Need to keep track of all running operations\r\n2. Some of our primitives only return an XLA token which doesn't have a `block_until_ready` method","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/4335/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}